{"municipality_code":"28586","pref":"兵庫県","city":"新温泉町","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。貴重な土木遺産もあります。","display_comment_enriched":"新温泉町には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・地域信仰に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 人物に目を向けるなら、武将・武士の宮城頼久や宮城豊嗣との縁をたどることで、街の歴史をより立体的に楽しめます。 「清富陣屋跡（城跡）」や「但馬御火浦（国の名勝および天然記念物）」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":1,"rank":1311,"percentile":22.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":26,"rank":980,"percentile":46.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":9,"rank":916,"percentile":46.8,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":4,"rank":882,"percentile":46.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":10,"rank":458,"percentile":73.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":2,"rank":320,"percentile":69.8,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":53,"rank":355,"percentile":80.7,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":1,"rank":102,"percentile":78.1,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["宮城頼久","宮城豊嗣","有本松太郎",